<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n983" root="أَكَرَ" body-key="A">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَرَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اَ^ََِ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكْرٌ</span>, <i>He tilled</i> the
ground; <i>ploughed</i> it <i>up for sowing.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<i>He dug</i> the ground. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He cut,</i> or <i>dug,</i>
a river, or canal, or rivulet. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَرَ</span>,
aor 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اَ^ََُ</span></b> , (TA,) inf. n. as above; (K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تأكّر</span></b> ;
(K;) <i>He dug a hollow,</i> or <i>cavity, in the ground,
for water to collect therein and to be baled out
therefrom clear:</i> (K, TA:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُكَرَّا</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تأكّر</span></b>  signifies <i>he dug hollows,</i> or <i>cavities, in the ground.</i> (S.)

